'''Summon Sentinel of Radiance''' is a [[minion]] [[skill]] granted by [[Radiant Crusade]], a Notable [[Ascendancy]] passive skill for the [[Guardian]]. It summons a Sentinel of Radiance that [[taunt]]s on hit and deals [[fire damage|fire]] [[damage over time]] to nearby enemies that scale with its maximum life. A portion of the damage you take is redirected to the Sentinel of Radiance's life pool while it's summoned. Only one Sentinel of Radiance may be active at a time.

==Mechanics==
Sentinel of Radiance has a cap of 1. It is a permanent minion and does not have a [[duration]].

Its fire DOT is somewhat similar to that of {{il|Righteous Fire}}, except that it is entirely scaled off of life, and does not damage the minion itself.

It does have an auto-attack, but it has an extremely low attack speed.

If for some reason the player wants to have [[Elemental Relic]]s but not Sentinel of Radiance, Sentinel of Radiance can be forcibly unsummoned by allocating the passive skill, disabling its minion type (e.g. {{il|The Dark Monarch}}), or by killing it using {{il|Summon Reaper}} or {{sl|Death Wish}}.

